



Mistral LLM (alone) — simple, direct text generation

 Mistral + LangChain + RAG — structured, contextual, enterprise-grade reasoning

Mistral LLM (Standalone Architecture)
┌──────────────────────────┐
│        User Query        │
│  "Fix my Kubernetes YAML"│
└────────────┬─────────────┘
             │
             ▼
     ┌─────────────────┐
     │  Mistral LLM    │
     │ (mistral-large) │
     └─────────────────┘
             │
             ▼
   ┌──────────────────────────────┐
   │ Generates response purely    │
